  <name>QuaverQ</name>
  <summary>QQ Music desktop client</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="zh_CN">QQ 音乐桌面客户端</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      QuaverQ is a third-party QQ Music desktop client built with PySide6 and
      Qt Quick. It offers discovery, multi-type search, a lyrics-first now-playing
      experience, cover caching and desktop media integration (MPRIS).
    </p>
    <p xml:lang="zh_CN">
      QuaverQ 是基于 PySide6 + Qt Quick 的第三方 QQ 音乐桌面客户端，提供发现、
      搜索、歌词优先的播放体验、封面缓存与桌面媒体集成（MPRIS）。
    </p>
  </description>
